{
  "key": "DB.PRES",
  "uri": "DB/PRES",
  "source": "help_center",
  "schema": {
    "PRES": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "ITEMS": {
          "description": "Items",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "压力荷载条目。⚠️ `DIRECTION` 必须显式给出 —— 省略会让服务端套用手册的默认值 `\"NORMAL\"`，而该值在 `ELEM_TYPE=\"PLATE\"` + `FACE_EDGE_TYPE=\"FACE\"` 上被拒（R143 / MD-17）。",
            "required": [
              "LCNAME",
              "FACE_EDGE_TYPE",
              "DIRECTION"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "ID": {
                "description": "ID",
                "type": "integer",
                "default": 0
              },
              "LCNAME": {
                "description": "LoadCaseName",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "GROUP_NAME": {
                "description": "LoadGroupName",
                "type": "string",
                "default": ""
              },
              "CMD": {
                "description": "CommandType（\"PRES\"）",
                "type": "string",
                "default": "PRES"
              },
              "ELEM_TYPE": {
                "description": "ElementType（\"PLATE\" / \"SOLID\" / \"PLANE\"）",
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "PLATE",
                  "SOLID",
                  "PLANE"
                ],
                "default": "PLATE"
              },
              "FACE_EDGE_TYPE": {
                "description": "PressureType（\"FACE\" / \"EDGE\" / \"PRES\"）",
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "FACE",
                  "EDGE",
                  "PRES"
                ]
              },
              "DIRECTION": {
                "description": "Direction（\"NORMAL\" / \"LX\" / \"LY\" / \"LZ\" / \"GX\" / \"GY\" / \"GZ\" / \"VECTOR\"）。⚠️ **必须显式给出**：省略会让服务端套用手册的默认值 `\"NORMAL\"`，从而在 `PLATE`+`FACE` 上报 `[Error] Errors detected in Pressure Loads Data.(Item:Load Direction)` —— 即「省略」与「填 NORMAL」在该组合下**同样失败**。手册的可用性矩阵：`PLATE`+`FACE` **排除 `NORMAL`**（用 `LZ`，单元局部 z 即板面法向）；`PLANE`+`EDGE` 排除 `GX`/`GY`/`GZ`；`PLATE`+`EDGE` 与 `SOLID`+`PRES` 接受全部八个。⚠️ 该排除**不**做成硬闸门 —— 原生错误本身是显式的，拒绝调用方显式给的值等于替工程师做工程决策。",
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "NORMAL",
                  "LX",
                  "LY",
                  "LZ",
                  "GX",
                  "GY",
                  "GZ",
                  "VECTOR"
                ]
              },
              "VECTORS": {
                "description": "VectorArray [X, Y, Z]（仅当 `DIRECTION=\"VECTOR\"`）",
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                "minItems": 3,
                "maxItems": 3
              },
              "OPT_PROJECTION": {
                "description": "ProjectionBoolean（仅对 `DIRECTION` 为 `GX`/`GY`/`GZ` 有意义）",
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              },
              "FORCES": {
                "description": "ForceArray",
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "EDGE_LOADS": {
                "description": "EdgeLoadArray",
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "PSLT_KEY": {
                "description": "PsltKey —— 指向 `/db/PSLT` 压力荷载类型的键。可选：压力荷载不需要有 `/db/PSLT` 类型支撑。（手册的 Specifications 表未列此字段，服务端 `/info` 两产品均声明。）",
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "EDGE_FACE": {
                "description": "EdgeFace —— 面/边编号（Solid: 1~6；Plate/Plane: 1~4）。⚠️ 手册标 Required 但**省略从未被实测**，且手册自己的示例省略了它 ⇒ 本 Schema **不**把它列入 `required`。",
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 6
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "direction": "response",
    "source": "l4_measured_envelope",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "PRES"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "PRES": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
